OL,3,GNEWSAThe beach cafe people are fighting
OL,4,Ato keep open
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of a "community-based"
OL,7,Fbeachside cafe facing closure is due to
OL,8,Fbe decided at a council meeting.
OL,10,FMore than 8,000 people have signed a
OL,11,Fpetition calling for SOBO Beach, in
OL,12,FBournemouth, to remain open.
OL,14,FThe venue, which employs 20 people, has
OL,15,Fa lease on a section of land on
OL,16,FSouthbourne Promenade that expires on
OL,17,FOctober 31.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
