OL,3,GNEWSAThe beach cafe people are fighting
OL,4,Ato keep open
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter running a tender process,
OL,7,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole
OL,8,F(BCP) Council said SOBO Beach was not
OL,9,Fthe preferred choice, and a decision
OL,10,Fwould be made at a full council meeting
OL,11,Flater.
